39877622316757", "text": "There’s an old Bengali folk belief about Goddess Lakshmi and her elder sister, Alakshmi, who is associated with misfortune and poverty. 😭🌾 People traditionally used a jhāṭā (broom) to symbolically drive Alakshmi out of the house before welcoming Lakshmi, the goddess of wealth and prosperity. It’s such an interesting part of our traditional folklore! 🪔✨", "timestamp": 1793201893, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "kash_here.0", "author_id": "48257121526", "id": "18131883826701322", "text": "Party 2 found me", "timestamp": 1793189086, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "thirool._.editz", "author_id": "66151428800", "id": "18103738040533137", "text": "Is she alakshmi ...😱😱", "timestamp": 1793171389, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "sanaaya_2112", "author_id": "6898464231", "id": "18126687967909883", "text": "Part 3", "timestamp": 1793162635, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "chanderbhansarpach", "author_id": "56048618141", "id": "18504995020100750", "text": "3rd part", "timestamp": 1793156594, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "anjali_jaiswal__04", "author_id": "7384388750", "id": "18077116427722928", "text": "Jb aati h dra kr chli jati h ye didi", "timestamp": 1793154079, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "yash___x___1___2", "author_id": "53711998018", "id": "17909740455579789", "text": "Part 3", "timestamp": 1793146244, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/De_IxJXjn68/", "webpage_url_basename": "De_IxJXjn68", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/868821865_18114154760065585_8930218179939517602_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=NDAxNjk2Nzk1NDMyMzExMTYxMjE4MTE0MTU0NzU0MDY1NTg1.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=04Dx9ptRHzkQ7kNvwGtXWW0&_nc_oc=Adr12vjUXHLNnsdjgAImRw0O-fZ5HSyOpH